MID_SE_Ism_Esm_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_A_001: Mm, the side got scraped, but... Nah, that's\nno problem.
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_A_002: Oh, Promised One! Busy? Come on, help me with\nthis boat. Take the rope.
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_A_003: That should do it. Thanks. Now I'm ready to fish as\nearly as tomorrow morning.
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_A_004: So you and everybody can look forward to a delicious\nfish breakfast!
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_A_005: <NCA>"I do look forward to it!"
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_A_006: <NCB>"That will make everyone happy."
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_A_007: <ACA>Hehehe. Hungry, are you? You don't bother to\nhide it!
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_A_008: <ACB>Sure. Nobody's stomach stops rumbling just because\nthere's a war!
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_A_009: My dad taught me to fish. No matter how bad\nthings get, I'll be out there trawling the waves.
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_A_010: I look around and I see so many people shaking with\nfear. They're scared to go to the underworld. Not me.
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_A_011: I mean, who wants to die? But it's not like Balor\nshowing up changed much for me.
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_A_012: We're fisherfolk. We battle the sea, and death is\nnever far.
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_A_013: When my dad died, I wasn't even shocked. You\nwould have thought I didn't even believe it.
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_A_014: It stormed so hard that day... Mom and I tried to stop\nhim, but he wouldn't listen, and he left.
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_A_015: And then he didn't come back. The storm lasted\nthree days, so we couldn't even search for him.
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_A_016: Ah...
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_A_017: My mom prayed through tears, but I didn't cry.
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_A_018: Because crying doesn't change anything. Even her\ntears dried up quickly.
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_A_019: And that's thanks to one thing. People die. Their\ntime comes, and that's it. That's life. *sniffle*
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_A_020: What? Why? *sniffle* No, I... *sniffle* I don't want\nto cry!
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_A_021: Mm... Oh, don't mind me. Remembering that day\nmade me a little sad is all.
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_A_022: That's it, right? Nobody wants to see this!
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_A_023: Thanks. I'm fine now. I feel a little better, even.
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_A_024: You're so unusual. Are you really a human, same\nas me?
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_A_025: OK, then. That means you're gonna die one day.
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_A_026: What's that supposed to mean? Stop pulling my leg.\nWell...I could also choose to believe it.
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_A_027: Gods? Devils? Who needs 'em? But you, I believe in.
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_A_028: But if I believe, you better not let me down. You're\ncoming back safe and sound. No matter what.
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_S: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_S_001: *sniffle* Some Promised One! Can't even live up to\nthe name...
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_S_002: If you call yourself the Promised One you should\nkeep your promises! You promised to come back!
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_S_003: Are... Are you a ghost? Are you haunting me?
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_S_004: Wait, you've got a shadow. And you smell like you.
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_S_005: It is you! You're back! You survived!
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_S_006: Promised One... You make me so mad!
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_S_007: SO mad! You had me worried! I thought you\nwere dead!
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_S_008: Now you'd better get ready...for a hug! *sob*
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_S_009: Whew... It's been a while since I let it all out\nlike that!
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_S_010: <NCA>"I thought you were going to kill me!"
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_S_011: <NCB>"All I did was keep my promise."
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_S_012: <ACA>You'd deserve it! You kept me waiting!
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_S_013: <ACB>Well, you kept me waiting! What did you expect?
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_S_014: But I'm so glad you're back. Really, really, really!
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_S_015: OK, so...you get a special treat. One-time offer. What\ndo you want? Don't be shy!
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_S_016: The sea? What about it?
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_S_017: <NCA>"I want to eat fish."
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_S_018: Oh! Ahahaha. You're hungry. Well, of course you are.\nYou're alive, aren't you?
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_S_019: OK, well, coming right up! I've got my boat, so off\nwe go!
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_S_020: <RSDS>The weather is good, and the catch should be\ngood too.
MID_SE_Ism_Esm_S_021: Enough for a banquet! And you can tell them it was\nall you. Imagine the look on their faces...